<blockquote>Captain Astor's Logbook</blockquote>
<blockquote>I had no intention of writing anything here, but I won't die in silence.</blockquote>
<blockquote>
Father, I pity you. I hate you.<br>
You told me I was weak, but I'm strong.<br>
You said I was slow, but I'm quick.
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
I wear the hawk thought you said I'd achieve nothing.<br>
For once I agree with you.<br>
I, and everyone else, have achieved nothing.
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
Nothingness below us. Nothingness all around us.<br>
Mother I dedicate myself to your memory,<br>
and I cut the Saborian<br>
mast and neck.
</blockquote>
